### Log in (returns { token, user }) - users come from users.json
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "alice123" }

### All requests below need:  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
@token = PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### List books (supports ?q=, ?genre=, ?read=true, ?page=, ?size=)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### One book
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Neuromancer", "author": "William Gibson", "genre": "Sci-Fi", "year": 1984, "pages": 271 }

### Update (send the version you have; a stale version returns 409)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/books/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Dune", "author": "Frank Herbert", "genre": "Sci-Fi", "year": 1965, "pages": 412, "read": true, "rating": 5, "version": 1 }

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/books/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
